# Rounds 17 and 17b, L §6.1 The joint model's own movements: "A read of that place in the joint model from the
# movement's day until the member's next reading of the place, a balance included, is a hole naming it ... Every
# result that reads the place on or after the movement's day lists it under left out: (§8.2)"; L §8.2 `left out:
# <move>, <n> instances, first <day>`. (No member reads b.konto after the day.) L6_1_joint_move_in_member_place's model (help, 50.00 PLN on 2026-05-05 from a.konto to
# b.konto, linked to nothing), read by flows over May (kf), by low over a span holding the day (kl) and by a balance on
# the day itself (kd): each a hole naming help, with help under left out:. snap8 printed kf with no left out: line.
=== options pin=bytes
=== joint.tally
model family
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  use a = "ana.tally" sha256 "0b0615a67a4ae71646df39a5edbd8b0a4fe46b72c4f53654cfa7eaa10b6a9a81"
  use b = "ben.tally" sha256 "4f927bb0b7b8b6a1acfc3c6b41ae7af8e9f8b78b4e5a331024f351ac66548a01"

source plan "plan"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input jday: date
input jamt: money PLN

move help: transfers
  on jday
  leg cash from a.konto to b.konto amount jamt

version jv
  cite plan
  governs always
  known 2026-01-02
  jday = 2026-05-05 "plan"
  jamt = 50.00 PLN "plan"
ask kf: flows(b.konto, 2026-05)
ask kl: low(b.konto, 2026-04-01 .. 2026-06-30)
ask kd: bal(b.konto, 2026-05-05)
=== ana.tally
model ana
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "umowa"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place to_ben: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input wage_amt: money PLN
input pay_dom: int
input gift_amt: money PLN
input gift_day: date

move wage[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, pay_dom)
  leg cash from world to konto amount wage_amt

move gift: transfers
  on gift_day
  leg cash from konto to to_ben amount gift_amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  wage_amt = 1 000.00 PLN "umowa"
  pay_dom = 10 "umowa"
  gift_amt = 300.00 PLN "plan"
  gift_day = 2026-03-15 "plan"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-12-31)
=== ben.tally
model ben
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "umowa"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-01-01..
place from_ana: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input gift_in: money PLN
input gift_day: date

move gift_in_m: transfers
  on gift_day
  leg cash from from_ana to konto amount gift_in

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  gift_in = 300.00 PLN "plan"
  gift_day = 2026-03-15 "plan"
  opening[konto] = 200.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-12-31)
=== expect kf kl kd
kf: ?"help crosses to b with no link" (help)
  left out: help, 1 instances, first 2026-05-05
  cut 2026-01-05
kl: ?"help crosses to b with no link" (help)
  left out: help, 1 instances, first 2026-05-05
  cut 2026-01-05
kd: ?"help crosses to b with no link" (help)
  left out: help, 1 instances, first 2026-05-05
  cut 2026-01-05
